# Effectiveness_Harness e2e build mode (AD-12).
#
# Loaded ONLY by `vite --mode e2e` (`pnpm build:e2e` / `pnpm preview:e2e`), which
# is the build the harness-dependent Playwright specs run against. It arms the
# `import.meta.env` guard in `spec/effectiveness/e2e-entry.ts`; the production
# build (`pnpm build`, mode `production`) never loads this file, so
# `window.__atlasHarness` cannot reach `dist/`.
VITE_E2E_HARNESS=1
